WEBVTT

00:02:00.575 --> 00:02:02.668
We killed thousands of Post-it notes.

00:02:02.692 --> 00:02:06.115
We made dozens of prototypes
to get to this.

00:02:06.139 --> 00:02:09.107
So this is the NeoNurture
infant incubator,

00:02:09.131 --> 00:02:12.805
and this has a lot of smarts
built into it, and we felt great.

00:02:12.829 --> 00:02:15.143
So the idea here is,
unlike the concept car,

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:17.021
we want to marry something beautiful

00:02:17.045 --> 00:02:19.524
with something that actually works.

00:02:19.548 --> 00:02:21.635
And our idea is that this design

00:02:21.659 --> 00:02:25.122
would inspire manufacturers
and other people of influence

00:02:25.146 --> 00:02:27.655
to take this model and run with it.

00:02:28.516 --> 00:02:31.173
Here's the bad news: